              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI naboolela Musa ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laka Haruni nabaanabe ori Amalako khukomusango omusambe ngakano; mbu omusango omusambe kube khushisambilo eshiokhushimalilo eshilo tulu okhuula olwa bushia; nakwo omulilo okwokhushimalilo kulindwe kwashenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omukuhani yeefwale inguboye yeikitani, kata nende iserwaliye yeikitani achiifwale khumubili; mana ayoye likoshe elia omulilo kukwisiye omusango omusambe khushimalilo, nalira mushibero shieshimalilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana yeefwalule tsingubotsie tsana, niyeefwala tsingubo tsindi, nachinga likoshe nalirusia elwanyi weikambi habundu halafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omulilo okuli khushimalilo kulindwe kwashilenjekhwo, kuleshe okhusima ta; omukuhani asundenjekhwo tsikhwi buli mutsuli; narakhwo omusango kwokhusambwa niyaanza bulayi, nasambilakhwo amasinya kemisango chiokhwishia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulilo kwashenje khushimalilo obushia nobushia; kuleshe okhusima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi amalako khukomusango kweimele ngakano; mbu abaana baHaruni bachimale imbeli w, hambeli weshimalilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulala khubo afumbare khubusie obunyushe bwomusango kweimele, nabukula khumafura kakwo, nobubaane bwosi obuli khumusango kweimele, nabisambila khushimalilo, bibe eshiitsulilo shiakwo, eshiuya eshilayi khuMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne eshitong'akhwo, Haruni nabaanabe balie; shiliibwe harali amameln ta, habundu undi ahatakatifu; bashiliile mulwanyi Iweliheema liokhwakaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shileshe okhufumbuukhwa namamela. Eshihaanilwe shibe omukabo kwabwe okwokhubihaanwa bianje ebikholelwa omulilo; neshitakatifu muno, shinga omusango kwobwonooni, kata shinga omusango kweshiuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli mundu weshisaatsa owomubaana baHaruni aliekhwo, shibe eshibakhoyeele tsindaalo tsiosi munzibulo tsieenywe, eshirula mubihaanwa biOMWAMI ebikholelwa omulilo; omundu yesi oubitiilakhwo alaba omutakatifu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
